  html+=empty('A dedicated view for referral performance.','Track who made an introduction, which prospects engaged and what progressed into qualified conversations or clients. Metrics and trends will appear after the source data is supplied.','Share a spreadsheet or export with referral IDs, dates, referring contact or partner, prospect, status and linked Pipedrive deal ID.');
  html+=`<div class="two-column">${panel('Activity and responses',notes(['Referral requests made and introductions promised.','Introductions completed, prospect responses and follow-ups.','Use actual event dates for reporting; keep current status separate from period activity.']),'PLANNED METRICS')}${panel('Commercial outcomes',notes(['Qualified referred leads, confirmed bookings and held meetings.','Accepted opportunities, won clients and value where verified.','Link referrals to CRM deals and deduplicate shared outcomes before comparing channels.']),'PLANNED METRICS')}</div>`;
